    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a></i> </p><p>Whenever you activate a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add one use of that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a> of one ally within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. Once used, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> cannot be regained by any means, and if the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> is not used by the end of the ally's next turn, it is lost. You or the ally can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Point\">Destiny Point</a> to have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> lost at the end of the encounter, instead of the end of the ally's next turn. </p><p>You can take this Force Secret only if you have successfully trained an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Apprentice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Apprentice\">Apprentice</a> to knighthood (or the equivalent rank for other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Traditions\" title=\"Force Traditions\">Force Traditions</a>). </p>",
